OL,3,BRussia retrieves burning cargo ship    
OL,4,Bfrom Gulf of Finland after drone strike
OL,5,GThe Sparta II ship was sailing to      
OL,6,GRussia's Baltic exclave of Kaliningrad 
OL,7,Gwhen it was struck by a drone, caught  
OL,8,Gfire, and drifted into Finland's       
OL,9,Gterritorial waters.                    
OL,10,K                                       
OL,11,BFinland struggles to keep kids fit     
OL,12,GOne in four boys and nearly one in five
OL,13,Ggirls aged 2 to 16 are overweight or   
OL,14,Gobese, according to the Finnish public 
OL,15,Ghealth authority THL.                  
OL,16,K                                       
OL,17,BSnow arrives in Helsinki               
OL,18,GForecasters say a cold, dry week is    
OL,19,Gahead.                                 
